                </h2>
            
            
                <div class="cm-main-banner__description">
                    <p>In response to the Paris Agreement, Cooler Master has established group-level greenhouse gas (GHG) reduction targets, decarbonization pathways, and transition strategies. Our science-based targets were officially validated by the Science Based Targets initiative (SBTi). Through continuous decarbonization efforts, we have achieved meaningful progress: in 2024, our absolute GHG emissions were approximately 59% lower than the 2022 base year, demonstrating steady advancement along our science-based reduction pathway.</p>
